# AuthSphere Web Frontend Environment Configuration

# Base URL for API requests executed inside the user's browser:
# - Production via Vercel Reverse Proxy (Recommended): Leave EMPTY!
#   The browser communicates with same-origin '/api/*', ensuring first-party HttpOnly cookies
#   and zero CORS preflights. The backend URL is defined in vercel.json.
# - Direct / Standalone Host (Bypassing Proxy): Set to explicit target URL (e.g. http://localhost:3000).
VITE_API_URL=
